1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,360
Can AI approve its own recommendation?

2
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:03,980
No.

3
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:10,480
EMOS separates reasoning, deterministic readiness, and human authority so that a

4
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:12,800
confident answer cannot authorize execution.

5
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:17,940
Readiness requires at least seventy percent evidence completeness and zero critical

6
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:18,580
gaps.

7
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:22,620
Needs Evidence blocks approval and execution progression.

8
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:25,685
The governed workflow requires explicit human sign-off.

9
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:29,880
An AI request to bypass approval cannot change these rules.

10
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:33,560
Even complete evidence does not remove the human decision.

11
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:39,740
Inspect the evidence gaps, recommendation, alternatives, and risks before approval.

12
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:45,560
Next, obtain accountable human review, then follow the disposition-specific plan.

13
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,040
EMOS tracks governed work; it does not autonomously change production infrastructure.
